	text: [
		"FTB Utilities are used for chunk loading in this pack, by default it’s set a limited number of maximum chunks. If you’re playing in single player or have permission on a server, you can use these commands to increase the maximum claimed and loaded chunks.",
		"",
		"To increase the maximum claimed chunks, use this command:",
		"",
		"/ranks set_permission player ftbutilities.claims.max_chunks 10000",
		"",
		"To increase the maximum loaded chunks, use this command:",
		"",
		"/ranks set_permission player ftbutilities.chunkloader.max_chunks 10000"
	],
